DIRECT
The RPC fuzz target (src/test/fuzz/rpc.cpp) aborts at start-up unless every registered RPC is in exactly one of its two lists.
Add each new command to RPC_COMMANDS_NOT_SAFE_FOR_FUZZING unless it is plainly cheap and free of side effects; see the header of this script.

"probe_rpc" (src/rpc/server.cpp:RegisterProbeRPCCommands) is registered but in neither RPC_COMMANDS_SAFE_FOR_FUZZING nor RPC_COMMANDS_NOT_SAFE_FOR_FUZZING in src/test/fuzz/rpc.cpp

